    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MANIC (2017 FILM)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MOVIE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Manic (2017 film) is a Canadian documentary film directed by Kalina Bertin, investigating parts of her father's life in Montserrat and receiving nominations at the 6th Canadian Screen Awards."</data>
